  "answer_text": "## \ud83d\udcfa Watch MSNBC (Now \"MS NOW\") Live Streaming Free Online\n\n> **Important Note:** MSNBC rebranded as **\"MS NOW\"** on November 15, keeping its core mission and programming focus. The change aligns with MSNBC's separation from NBCUniversal into the new entity **Versant**. The brand changed, but the core political coverage, familiar hosts, and daily rhythm of the channel remain recognizable to longtime viewers.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udd93 Free Live Streaming Links\n\nHere are the best websites to watch MSNBC / MS NOW live online **for free**:\n\n| # | Website | Link |\n|---|---------|------|\n| 1 | **MS NOW Official** | [ms.now/live](https://www.ms.now/live) |\n| 2 | **LiveNewsNow** | [livenewsnow.com](https://www.livenewsnow.com/featured/msnbc.html) |\n| 3 | **LiveNewsChatEU** | [livenewschat.eu](https://livenewschat.eu/msnbc-live-stream/) |\n| 4 | **USNewsON** | [usnewson.com](https://usnewson.com/watch/msnbc-live) |\n| 5 | **NewsLive** | [newslive.com](https://www.newslive.com/american/msnbc-news-live.html) |\n| 6 | **LiveNewsWorld** | [livenewsworld.com](https://www.livenewsworld.com/msnbc-live-stream/) |\n| 7 | **FreeInterTV** | [freeintertv.com](http://www.freeintertv.com/view/id-2565) |\n| 8 | **UFreeTV** | [ufreetv.com](https://ufreetv.com/msnbc.html) |\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcf1 Other Ways to Watch (Paid/Free Trial)\n\n- **YouTube TV** \u2013 Start a free trial to watch MSNBC Live on YouTube TV. Stream live TV from ABC, CBS, FOX, NBC, ESPN & popular cable networks, with cloud DVR and no storage limits.\n- **NBC News App** \u2013 MSNBC publishes free segments, interviews, and breaking news clips through the MSNBC website and the NBC News mobile app, allowing viewers to access important political updates without cost.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcf2 Devices Supported\n\nMSNBC live streaming allows viewers to watch the channel's real-time broadcast through the internet without needing traditional cable. You can access it on **smartphones, laptops, tablets, and smart TVs**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd56 Best Time to Watch\n\nThe peak watching time of MSNBC news live is **prime time, starting from 7PM to 10PM**.\n\n---\n\n> \ud83d\udca1 **Tip:** If the player takes a moment to load, refresh the page once and allow a few seconds for the stream to begin.",
